IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `eia-core-interpretation`
IMPORT `ei7-related-nouns`
IMPORT `ei7-related-2016-2018`

-- Tests of ei7-related-2016-2018. Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the related provision
-- named above it (src:3795-3839, 3884-3886). Days that an order or an amending Act leaves open ("the day fixed by
-- order", "the day on which ... come into force") are not in the deposited text, so the days used for them are chosen
-- to test the boundary and are not the real days.

§ `2016, c. 7, s. 225`

-- began July 8, 2017 and has not ended: earlier text continues.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 225 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 7 8), (YearMonthDay 2018 7 7))
-- began on July 9, 2017: not "before that day".
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 225 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 7 9), (YearMonthDay 2018 7 8)))
-- last day July 8, 2017: ended before that day.
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 225 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2016 1 3), (YearMonthDay 2017 7 8)))
-- last day July 9, 2017: has not ended before that day.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 225 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2016 1 3), (YearMonthDay 2017 7 9))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 225 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 7 8), (YearMonthDay 2018 7 7)) EQUALS LIST `ei7 s 2(1) the definition long-tenured worker`, `ei7 ss 10(13.1) to (14.1)`, `ei7 ss 12(2) to (2.8) and (6)`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 225 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 7 9), (YearMonthDay 2018 7 8)) EQUALS EMPTY

§ `2016, c. 7, s. 226`

-- the day fixed under subsection 231(3) is taken as August 5, 2018.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 226 the listed provisions as enacted apply in respect of the benefit period` (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 226 the listed provisions as enacted apply in respect of the benefit period` (YearMonthDay 2018 8 4) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 226 the provisions that apply as enacted` (YearMonthDay 2019 1 6) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5) EQUALS LIST `ei7 s 2(5)`, `ei7 s 7(2) the portion before paragraph (a)`, `ei7 s 7.1(1) the portion before the table, and s 7.1(3)`, `ei7 s 152.07(7)`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 226 the provisions that apply as enacted` (YearMonthDay 2018 8 4) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5) EQUALS EMPTY

§ `2016, c. 7, s. 227`

-- the day fixed under subsection 231(4) is taken as August 5, 2018.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 227 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YearMonthDay 2018 8 4) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 227 the earlier text of the listed provisions continues to apply in respect of the benefit period` (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 227 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YearMonthDay 2018 8 4) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5) EQUALS LIST `ei7 s 6(1) the definition waiting period`, `ei7 s 13`, `ei7 s 22(4)`, `ei7 s 152.01(1) the definition waiting period`, `ei7 s 152.15`
#ASSERT `Act RP 2016 c. 7 s. 227 the provisions whose earlier text continues to apply` (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5) (YearMonthDay 2018 8 5) EQUALS EMPTY

§ `2017, c. 20, s. 254`

-- the day on which sections 235 and 245 come into force is taken as December 3, 2017.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 254 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part I` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 254 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part VII.1` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3)
-- a child born on the day itself is not born "before that day".
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 254 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part I` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))
-- Part VIII benefits are not under section 23 or 152.05.
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 254 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part VIII` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))
-- another reason is not a section 23 or 152.05 benefit.
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 254 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part I` `pregnancy` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 254 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part VII.1` `care or support of a critically ill child` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))

§ `2017, c. 20, s. 255`

-- the day on which sections 237 and 247 come into force is taken as December 3, 2017.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 255 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23.2 or 152.061` `care or support of a critically ill child` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 255 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23.2 or 152.061` `care or support of a critically ill child` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 255 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23.2 or 152.061` `care or support of a critically ill adult` (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))

§ `2017, c. 20, s. 256`

-- the day on which sections 238 and 248 come into force is taken as December 3, 2017.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 256 sections 23.3 and 152.062 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3), (YearMonthDay 2018 12 1)) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 256 sections 23.3 and 152.062 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2), (YearMonthDay 2018 11 30)) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 256 sections 23.3 and 152.062 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2), (YearMonthDay 2018 11 30)) (YearMonthDay 2017 11 26) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))
#ASSERT `Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 256 sections 23.3 and 152.062 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 6 4), (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3)) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2017 c. 20 s. 256 sections 23.3 and 152.062 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2017 6 4), (YearMonthDay 2017 12 2)) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3) (YearMonthDay 2017 12 3))

§ `2018, c. 27, s. 307`

-- the day on which section 307 comes into force is taken as March 1, 2019.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2018 c. 27 s. 307 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part I` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2019 2 28) (YearMonthDay 2019 3 1)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2018 c. 27 s. 307 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part VII.1` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2019 2 28) (YearMonthDay 2019 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2018 c. 27 s. 307 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part I` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2019 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2019 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2018 c. 27 s. 307 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part VIII` `caring for a new-born or adopted child` (YearMonthDay 2019 2 28) (YearMonthDay 2019 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2018 c. 27 s. 307 the earlier Act continues to apply to the claimant for paying benefits under section 23 or 152.05` `Part I` `care or support of a family member` (YearMonthDay 2019 2 28) (YearMonthDay 2019 3 1))
